Venus × Minerva uses a path-scoped mixed licensing policy for its first public release.

Original theory, Canon, documentation, knowledge, and manuscripts published in this repository: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
Original software published in this repository: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0.
Third-party material is not relicensed by this repository and remains subject to its own rights and terms.
Commercial permissions for project-held copyright may be granted separately in writing.

No earlier Venus × Minerva / predecessor public license grant is being carried forward: the predecessor repositories and manuscript packages were internal and unpublished. Historical license notices in private archaeology are provenance of prior intent only.

The complete license texts and scope map are in LICENSES/ and LICENSE_POLICY.md.
